{"l":3554,"g":5,"b":3,"cefr":"A2","role":"reinforcement","insight":"conceptual_bridge","k":"h","variant":"authored","q":"Hvad siger man på engelsk, når du er faret vild og vil spørge om vej til biblioteket?","o":["Excuse me, how do I get to the library?","Excuse me, how I get to the library?","Excuse me, where do I go the library?","Sorry me, how do I get to the library?"],"a":"Excuse me, how do I get to the library?","r":"Man spørger om vej med 'How do I get to …?'."},
